<title>USA: FINAL PRICING - Bonne Terre, Mo.,.</title>
<headline>FINAL PRICING - Bonne Terre, Mo.,.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Edward D. Jones &amp; Co said it received the written award for the 1.930 million Bonne Terre, Mo., certificates of participation, Series 1997, with a top yield of 6.375 percent in 2017.</p>
